Data Model
PostgreSQL
Application state:
users, permissions, instruments metadata, trade types, strategies, strategy versions, risk profiles, orders, order events, fills, positions, backtests, models, watchlists, audit.
ClickHouse
Market analytics:
ticks, quotes, depth, candles, futures, options, features, structure events, liquidity events, profiles, regimes, signals, scanner results.
Redis
Hot state:
latest quotes, current candles, active subscriptions, current regime, active signals, short-lived coordination.
Object storage
Raw feeds, historical archives, Parquet feature datasets, research datasets and model artifacts.
Versioning
Store algorithm/model/feature version on derived records where reproducibility matters.
